<h4><a class="anchor" name="replyparameters" href="https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#replyparameters" id="replyparameters"><i class="anchor-icon"></i></a>ReplyParameters</h4>
<p>Describes reply parameters for the message that is being sent.</p>
