<h4><a class="anchor" name="keyboardbuttonpolltype" href="https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#keyboardbuttonpolltype" id="keyboardbuttonpolltype"><i class="anchor-icon"></i></a>KeyboardButtonPollType</h4>
