<li>Entities must not be nested, use parse mode <a href="https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#markdownv2-style">MarkdownV2</a> instead.</li>
<li>There is no way to specify ‚Äúunderline‚Äù, ‚Äústrikethrough‚Äù, ‚Äúspoiler‚Äù, ‚Äúblockquote‚Äù, ‚Äúexpandable_blockquote‚Äù, ‚Äúcustom_emoji‚Äù, and ‚Äúdate_time‚Äù entities, use parse mode <a href="https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#markdownv2-style">MarkdownV2</a> instead.</li>
