<td>Integer</td>
<td>Optional</td>
<td>Unique identifier for the target message thread</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>draft_id</td>
<td>Integer</td>
<td>Yes</td>
<td>Unique identifier of the message draft; must be non-zero. Changes to drafts with the same identifier are animated.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>text</td>
<td>String</td>
<td>Optional</td>
<td>Text of the message to be sent, 0-4096 characters after entities parsing. Pass an empty text to show a ‚ÄúThinking‚Ä¶‚Äù placeholder.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>parse_mode</td>
<td>String</td>
<td>Optional</td>
