<p>Changes the emoji status for a given user that previously allowed the bot to manage their emoji status via the Mini App method <a href="https://core.telegram.org/bots/webapps#initializing-mini-apps">requestEmojiStatusAccess</a>. Returns <em>True</em> on success.</p>
