<h4><a class="anchor" name="maskposition" href="https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#maskposition" id="maskposition"><i class="anchor-icon"></i></a>MaskPosition</h4>
<p>This object describes the position on faces where a mask should be placed by default.</p>
<table class="table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Field</th>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>point</td>
<td>String</td>
<td>The part of the face relative to which the mask should be placed. One of ‚Äúforehead‚Äù, ‚Äúeyes‚Äù, ‚Äúmouth‚Äù, or ‚Äúchin‚Äù.</td>
